    <description>Council voted unanimously on Aug 6, 2026 to begin the state-law process for a temporary moratorium; it was not itself a 90-day moratorium. After hearings on Sept 15 and Oct 20, first reading of the ordinance passed unanimously Oct 20. Second and final reading of Ordinance No. 2026-11-03, a 90-day moratorium running from adoption, was on the Nov 17 consent agenda; adoption is not yet confirmed from minutes</description>
